    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BKG303 · Assessment 2/6</span>\n<h2>Essay test</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 12402 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BKG303 · Đầu điểm 2/6</span>\n<h2>Essay test</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 12402 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">15.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">In class (45-60 minutes)</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO3, CLO4, CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Multiple choice questions and/or Criticial thinking (exercises) questions.<br>For example:<br>▪ Part 1 (40%): 20 multiple choice questions in 20 minutes<br>▪ Part 2 (60%): 3 exercises in 30 minutes</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">OP 1- Only MCQ: 40-50 questions<br>OP 2- Only Critical thinking questions/ Exercises : 3-4 question.<br>OP 3- Mix: 15-20 mcqs + 2-3 critical thinking questions/exercises</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">All chapters</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Paper/computer-based testing</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">The questions are representative of chapter materials. Students are required to read the textbook. The Final essay accounts for 15% of the final score.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 25 — Midterm Test</li><li>Session 26 — Midterm Test</li><li>Session 60 — Essay Test - Review</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 25 — Midterm Test</li><li>Buổi 26 — Midterm Test</li><li>Buổi 60 — Essay Test - Review</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=BKG303\">Exam Room — BKG303</a> (3 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=BKG303\">Phòng thi — BKG303</a> (3 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
